      en: ["Built in the 15th century (around 1459) by Khan Jahan Ali.", "Recognized as a UNESCO World Heritage Site since 1985.", "Actually has 81 domes (77 small ones and 4 at the corners).", "Supported by a total of 60 massive stone pillars.", "The walls are approximately 1.8 meters thick for stability.", "The dimensions are roughly 49 meters by 33 meters."],
